        "seedName": "Greater Lore (Loremaster)"
      },
      "Lore": {
        "description": "Loremasters are collectors of knowledge. Starting at 2nd level, a loremaster gains the ability to recall legends and obscure information on a variety of subjects, functioning similarly to a bard's bardic knowledge ability. She adds her loremaster level and her Intelligence modifier to the lore check.",
